title: "Quotient-Torus Port Lifting, Infinite Odd-Cycle Packing Families, and Zero-Mathlib Six-Kernel Certificates for Zero-Error Shannon Capacity"
message: "If you use these formal proofs, verification engines, or manuscript results, please cite this repository."
