abstract: >-
  A zero-Mathlib Lean 4.35.0 formalization (verified across six independent proof kernels
  with zero native_decide and zero sorry), companion Rust/C11/Python verification engines,
  and AMS-LaTeX preprint establishing: (1) the Intra-Coset Obstruction Theorem for 2D
  quotient codes in C_n^4 and discovery of the 45-ball subgroup H* = <(1,0,0,2),(0,1,0,4)>
  yielding infinite exact-ceiling odd-cycle packings for n = 8k+1 and automatic n^2-port
  systems for n = 16j+9; (2) four consecutive new all-time lower bounds on the Shannon
  capacity of odd cycles C_25, C_27, C_29, and C_31; (3) exact anatomy, induced C_5 engine,
  weighted fractional-clique-cover barrier, and two-sided heterogeneous composition for the
  7-letter separation calculus (resolving Tandon arXiv:2608.30273 Open Problem #2); and
  (4) the first zero-Mathlib six-kernel proofs of Lovasz's pentagon theorem Theta(C_5)=sqrt(5)
  and Haemers's 1979 Schlafli-graph Shannon super-multiplicativity paradox.
